）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260127/1092870973360705536902738.png/Iy1mY7g7f3xmgE49KnG9RBO_WHQXqpgQR3ov70d6L-8\"/><figcaption>9. 生肖猴（01製圖；AI生成圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"9. 生肖猴（01製圖；AI生成圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260127/1092870975684481024649138.png/x2aWqhWMZ68Z_dKqBt7L33pQ6G9_KkhEEINHbxCDR28\"/><figcaption>9. 生肖猴（01製圖；AI生成圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"10. 生肖雞（01製圖；AI生成圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260127/1092870977781764096534207.png/_fbXoOhkjqR_Vv-MAEORLBFiyPbN1dgNMtPtmTLT7Zk\"/><figcaption>10. 生肖雞（01製圖；AI生成圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"10. 生肖雞（01製圖；AI生成圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260127/1092870979971321856274306.png/TNjld0UiJYX6gDchm6zr67FByFi6m4ZXY_FDPmPxQz4\"/><figcaption>10. 生肖雞（01製圖；AI生成圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"11. 生肖狗（01製圖；AI生成圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260127/1092870966352023552693182.png/XOWKmtOnW4pmXLZ9n-KIPg4gHWkzo5_9X-2gGl_toBo\"/><figcaption>11. 生肖狗（01製圖；AI生成圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"11. 生肖狗（01製圖；AI生成圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260127/1092870968965206016329746.png/SIR05qlMu1XQQzdGjzluuQ1Fr61dTQ8QzwooPM8KKDw\"/><figcaption>11. 生肖狗（01製圖；AI生成圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"12. 生肖豬（01製圖；AI生成圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260127/1092870972836679680146325.png/WPoe-pDyxY4iv2X0MPIaufjbZ9WZhWOV1ufDPdbnwz0\"/><figcaption>12. 生肖豬（01製圖；AI生成圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"12. 生肖豬（01製圖；AI生成圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260127/1092870975290478592140732.png/2OtU1H8pghCcmnYsVbA9jZaKLQenAf0hsyl1jbMpdY0\"/><figcaption>12. 生肖豬（01製圖；AI生成圖）</figcaption></figure><p>一篇文帶你搞懂基礎 MBTI！「16型人格」準嗎？I型人與E型人怎麼分？這篇懶人包「7大重點」解析給你知</p><p>MBTI不只看外向E&amp;內向I！感知功能「實感S」和「直覺N」差很大：S人務實、N人愛幻想，據說牛頓百分百是N人？</p><p>【本文獲「Bella儂儂」授權刊出，未經同意禁止轉載。更多精彩報導，詳見《Bella儂儂》。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T11:39:21.266716+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2397,"images":41,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T11:32:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T17:17:45.022693+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T11:37:59.497671+00:00","content_hash":"d78228de0c2c06399e6c1270b879cc3daea1f1852f5a971da686307727e698f0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}